{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoilRootEval","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoilRootEval","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trP_sum_at_root_offset","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trP_sum_at_root_offset","kind":"theorem","line":575,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoilRootEval.lean#L575-L587","doc":"**Offset root evaluation** — under `(w⁴)^{n+2} = 1` and `w⁴ ≠ 1`, the\ntrefoil Rosso–Jones cyclotomic sum truncated at `n` has the same\nclosed form `(−1)^n w^{6n(n+2)} [n+1]_{w²}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trP_sum_at_root_self","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trP_sum_at_root_self","kind":"theorem","line":560,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoilRootEval.lean#L560-L573","doc":"**Self-matched root evaluation** — under `(w⁴)^M = 1` and `w⁴ ≠ 1`,\nthe trefoil Rosso–Jones cyclotomic sum has the closed form\n`(−1)^M w^{6M(M+2)} [M+1]_{w²}`.  (Stated with the explicit sum so\nthat `trP` in `AJTrefoilAnnihilation` unfolds to it definitionally.) ","signatureChunk":0}]}